          "kind": "text",
          "value": "Sorted data is8,15,17,19,21,23,25,35. Nearest-rank Q1=15,Q3=23,IQR=8. The upper fence is23+1.5×8=35; no observation is strictly greater than35, so there are0upper outliers."
        }
      ],
